N5008 [dcl.fct.def.default]/5 + [class.copy.ctor]/14-15: an explicitly
defaulted copy/move constructor is defined as the memberwise copy/move of
bases and members regardless of the members' types.  It was generated only
when every member was trivially copyable; otherwise the body stayed EMPTY
and the members were default-initialised: copying std::pair<const
std::string, int> lost the string, copying a pair holding a std::function
produced an empty function.
